# Rakish Crew: "Whenever an outlaw you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life." On turn 1 Bot1 casts it
# (its Mercenary token enters) and a Muck Rats, which is no outlaw. On turn 2 Bot2 casts a Triton Shorethief (a Rogue, so an outlaw,
# but Bot2's) and shocks first the Rats (no trigger: a creature, not an outlaw) and then the Mercenary token (an outlaw Bot1
# controls: Bot1 gains 1 and Bot2 loses 1). On turn 3 Bot1 shocks Bot2's Shorethief, an outlaw an opponent controls: no trigger
# (CR 700.12, 603.10a).

